Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.29,0:00:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,在结婚前我就梦想着开一家私人按摩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.51,0:00:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,店
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.91,0:00:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,现在趁着老公长期出差
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.41,0:00:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,利用家里空出来的房间开了这家小店
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.15,0:00:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,今天是开业日
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.72,0:00:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然有很多不安
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.56,0:00:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,但既然开始了就要努力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 下次再麻烦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.38,0:00:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,请多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.43,0:00:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,夏希
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.94,0:00:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,夏希啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.11,0:00:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.86,0:01:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我这就去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.55,0:01:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.46,0:01:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,其实今天公司那边
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.58,0:01:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,提到了让我去海外分公司工作
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.36,0:01:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我在结婚前就申请过海外工作的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.20,0:01:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,部长看到了我的申请
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.53,0:01:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,就说非常希望我去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.36,0:01:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,什么时候开始呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.12,0:01:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他们希望我能在下个月就开始
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.45,0:01:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,又是突然的消息啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.50,0:01:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我不去的话 他们会找别人代替
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.98,0:01:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我想抓住这个机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.30,0:01:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.36,0:01:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说要工作多久
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.92,0:01:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,最短半年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.28,0:02:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,看情况可能会一年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.13,0:02:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这样好吗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.28,0:02:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,时间还挺长的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.41,0:02:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,再说 这里刚买下来不久
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.00,0:02:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,夏希你怎么想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.17,0:02:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我英语不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.90,0:02:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话 我不太有信心能在海外工作
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.10,0:02:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.57,0:02:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那真是可惜了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.02,0:02:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,要跟公司说一声吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.39,0:02:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.72,0:02:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我不想在海外工作
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.56,0:02:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,对于你来说 这是长久以来的梦想啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.34,0:02:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.04,0:02:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,再说 我可能会变成单人赴任
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.62,0:02:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,或者是单身不育
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.65,0:02:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,即便是最坏的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.95,0:02:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我也能接受单身赴任
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.94,0:02:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.68,0:02:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,如果最长时间是一年的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.48,0:02:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,请问 您需要穿上这件内裤吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.98,0:03:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不想因为我的原因而让你的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.01,0:03:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,破灭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.52,0:03:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,再说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.92,0:03:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,如果只有我一个人住的话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.71,0:03:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这个房子太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.62,0:03:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,在你不在的期间
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.02,0:03:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我一直想开的私人按摩店
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.16,0:03:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里做可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.84,0:03:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.62,0:03:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,真的谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.90,0:03:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我的梦想也实现了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.58,0:03:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我也会帮你实现梦想的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.52,0:03:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那我先去睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.24,0:03:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.34,0:03:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.14,0:03:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.92,0:03:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,从今天开始营业
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.46,0:03:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有空的话请来光顾一下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.66,0:04:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.97,0:04:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在家里开的吗\N- 开了之后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.88,0:04:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,真是个好女人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.75,0:04:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,氨（此处应为“阿门”）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.63,0:04:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.39,0:04:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,去试试吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.53,0:04:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,下次还请多多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.73,0:04:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,下一个预约是从傍晚开始的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.50,0:04:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这段时间会空出来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.31,0:04:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.60,0:04:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.26,0:04:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我拿了张传单来 现在可以做吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.95,0:04:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,现在的话没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.74,0:04:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 那我就不客气了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.37,0:05:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要先做个咨询呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.86,0:05:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 那个太麻烦了 算了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.18,0:05:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,如果做了的话我会解释的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.00,0:05:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,客人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.38,0:05:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 就在这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.30,0:05:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.91,0:05:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这个地方不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.26,0:05:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 这里有专用的裤子 请穿上好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.20,0:05:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜欢那种 硬邦邦的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.38,0:05:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,请问客人 可以请您穿上这条裤子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.95,0:05:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,请
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.50,0:05:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法 知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.05,0:05:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这太小了 不脱也行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.81,0:05:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.82,0:05:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这样可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.38,0:05:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.98,0:06:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 我们从俯卧开始 请您趴下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.94,0:06:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.74,0:06:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我要开始了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.21,0:06:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 那请多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.00,0:06:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,请多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.46,0:06:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,再靠近点好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.42,0:06:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,再近一点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.32,0:06:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.64,0:06:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,对对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.04,0:06:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,对对对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.73,0:06:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.17,0:06:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,颈部也挺紧的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.00,0:06:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 从颈部开始
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.65,0:06:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 多少钱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.18,0:06:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,肩胛骨这里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.54,0:06:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那边也是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.43,0:06:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.10,0:06:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,下面一点 靠近背部的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.68,0:06:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这边吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.58,0:06:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,对对对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.98,0:06:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.77,0:06:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.42,0:06:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,客人来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.45,0:07:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.28,0:07:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我有点儿不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.98,0:07:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,手指甲裂开了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.48,0:07:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.98,0:07:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,继续继续 别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.57,0:07:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么去那边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.50,0:07:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这边力气更大
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.82,0:07:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,腰部也来一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.52,0:07:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,客人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.03,0:07:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.16,0:07:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,可以把手放旁边吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.48,0:07:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.37,0:07:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.14,0:07:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,真是为难
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.86,0:07:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,再来点儿臀部怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.90,0:07:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.54,0:07:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,再往下一点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.46,0:08:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 再往下\N- 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.13,0:08:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.96,0:08:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这一圈都来一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.78,0:08:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,整个都来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.90,0:08:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.61,0:08:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.12,0:08:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.00,0:08:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的很好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.78,0:08:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.30,0:08:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.40,0:08:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.29,0:08:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,店开张为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.82,0:08:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这样做真的很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.62,0:08:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.02,0:08:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,热起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.86,0:08:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你做得真好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.51,0:08:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.12,0:08:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这家店肯定会很火
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.69,0:08:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不常响呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.40,0:08:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.01,0:08:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,再来点儿大腿内侧怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.70,0:08:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 大腿内侧\N- 对对对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.64,0:08:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,对对 大腿根部也来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.94,0:09:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.08,0:09:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.02,0:09:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.85,0:09:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,呼~
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.85,0:09:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,有点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.41,0:09:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,胸口朝下躺着有点儿难受
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.64,0:09:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,可以让我仰面躺着吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.72,0:09:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.51,0:09:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨哟 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.50,0:09:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我胖了些
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.36,0:09:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,真是不容易呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.45,0:09:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 那我开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.08,0:09:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,可以帮我做一下腹部按摩吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.66,0:09:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,腹部
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.21,0:09:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.38,0:09:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.08,0:10:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.89,0:10:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.40,0:10:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,再认真一点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.78,0:10:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 这个让你在意了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.56,0:10:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.26,0:10:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才一直在看你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.50,0:10:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 没有那回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.81,0:10:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.76,0:10:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是感兴趣对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.82,0:10:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不过话说回来 你的内裤好小啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.83,0:10:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是挺小的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.18,0:10:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,可能会有点不舒服呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.10,0:10:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.77,0:11:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,位置不太对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.46,0:11:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.81,0:11:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我来调整一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.78,0:11:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,继续 继续
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.80,0:11:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.84,0:11:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.18,0:11:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,紧紧地
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.29,0:11:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 对了 这里 这里 你可以帮我按摩这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.16,0:11:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,按摩这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.06,0:11:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,对对对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.96,0:11:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 真舒服 真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.38,0:12:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 真舒服 真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.58,0:12:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不不
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.32,0:12:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你真的想看 我可以给你看看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.66,0:12:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,没有那回事 没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.10,0:12:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才一直在看着我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.60,0:12:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是吗你是不是压抑了\N- 我可没那意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.76,0:12:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,看吧 别不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.36,0:12:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我们这里不允许这种行为
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.70,0:12:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.63,0:12:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是你的服务
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.95,0:12:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,而是为了满足你压抑的需求
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.88,0:12:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,给你这个不满家伙的服务啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.78,0:12:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.00,0:12:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,要是想摸也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.54,0:12:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.73,0:12:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是不是很想摸\N- 没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.77,0:12:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 这里是为了让你放松的地方吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.00,0:12:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.42,0:13:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这样紧绷着 根本没法放松啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.66,0:13:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你的工作不就是让我放松吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.78,0:13:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不 这个我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,看 就是那边 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.42,0:13:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才也是这样做的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.12,0:13:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,只是看你有没有看到的区别而已
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.62,0:13:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这样太难受了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.42,0:13:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这样子的话 你应该能理解我的痛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.68,0:13:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.40,0:13:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,抓一下就好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.38,0:13:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这种事情我做不到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.32,0:13:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是挺好的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.49,0:13:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,做这个就好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.84,0:13:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,要不换个地方做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.57,0:13:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.74,0:13:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才是什么声音
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.69,0:13:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那今天的时间就到这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.28,0:14:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.44,0:14:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,再延长一下可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.24,0:14:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 下一位客人已经预约了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.82,0:14:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.30,0:14:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.70,0:14:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.78,0:14:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那请你换衣服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.47,0:14:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 请多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.46,0:14:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我还会再来哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.53,0:14:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.05,0:14:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 按摩店那边怎么样\N- 嗯 才刚开始呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.30,0:14:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,还行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.52,0:14:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.32,0:14:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,果然是没事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.11,0:15:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,别太勉强自己了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.46,0:15:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那等我心情好点再联系你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.88,0:15:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.96,0:18:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.03,0:18:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.12,0:18:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,本来应该是不喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.88,0:18:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我忍不住自慰了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.98,0:18:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我忍不住自慰了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.27,0:18:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.74,0:18:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这种事情
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.54,0:18:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话 我也不能跟老公说了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.10,0:18:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.51,0:18:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.50,0:18:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,又来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.68,0:19:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我要打扰你了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.09,0:19:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 请进
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.78,0:19:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,空着吧 那我就再麻烦你一次了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.20,0:19:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,请问客人 可以请您穿上这条裤子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.74,0:19:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.98,0:19:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前也说过
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.68,0:19:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是不喜欢这种东西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.42,0:19:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,太紧了 而且很硬
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.34,0:19:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是觉得不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.41,0:19:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,所以今天
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.68,0:19:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我就选这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.56,0:19:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,请客人穿上这条裤子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.42,0:19:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,客人会感到不舒服的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.10,0:19:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.75,0:19:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,至少让我披块毛巾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.51,0:19:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,氨（此处建议根据上下文调整为更合
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.35,0:19:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,适的表达
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.75,0:19:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,如“算了”）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.15,0:19:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.80,0:20:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是那么漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.49,0:20:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.28,0:20:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就从趴着开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.66,0:20:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,今天
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.56,0:20:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我的背还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.66,0:20:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,上次肩膀那里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.76,0:20:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我想重点按摩一下那里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.00,0:20:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.42,0:20:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.74,0:20:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,再用力点
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.32,0:20:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还要更多吗\N- 嗯 对 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.97,0:20:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的技术很好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.22,0:20:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.93,0:20:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.29,0:20:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,再用力点 锁骨周围这些地方
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.89,0:20:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,对 就是这样 再用力点 再多一点
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.70,0:21:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,对 就是这样 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.16,0:21:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,别停 继续
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.31,0:21:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,对 就是这样 这里肯定很紧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.63,0:21:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,一定很僵硬吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.39,0:21:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.68,0:21:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 感觉真好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.98,0:21:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,对 就是这样 再这样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.37,0:21:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,能帮我放松一下大胸肌吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.92,0:21:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我放松一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.92,0:21:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你用力点也没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.06,0:21:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,再用力点
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.86,0:21:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,对 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.41,0:21:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.04,0:21:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.86,0:21:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,再用力点
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.60,0:22:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,把肌肉都捏住
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.20,0:22:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,对 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.18,0:22:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.46,0:22:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.03,0:22:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你收钱是为了让客人放松吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.70,0:22:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.54,0:22:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.49,0:22:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我的放松就是这个样子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.22,0:22:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你要认真帮我按摩才行
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.18,0:22:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.89,0:22:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了我的手指
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.33,0:22:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这个手指
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.50,0:22:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不能这样弯曲
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.83,0:22:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.58,0:22:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.89,0:23:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那接下来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.24,0:23:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来做一下裸体按摩怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.28,0:23:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,裸体按摩
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.98,0:23:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你的髋关节都僵硬了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.17,0:23:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我是这么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.80,0:23:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.02,0:23:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.93,0:23:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,姿势有点不好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.34,0:23:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了在意什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.98,0:23:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.70,0:23:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.03,0:23:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,上次你也一直在看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.94,0:24:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 再用力点
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.66,0:24:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.58,0:24:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我们不是这种店 请不要这样做
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.96,0:24:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这种店是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.32,0:24:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是在教你哪里紧张而已
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.26,0:24:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.48,0:24:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,或者说 你是不是在意我的那个
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.46,0:24:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 不是这个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.45,0:24:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.98,0:24:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你这样有点过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.58,0:24:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你经常这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.62,0:24:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己刚才也一副想要的样子看着我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.30,0:24:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,继续吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.02,0:24:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.98,0:24:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,比如说
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.12,0:24:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.21,0:24:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.96,0:25:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的东西你也感兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.26,0:25:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你想看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.98,0:25:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我没看
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.04,0:25:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.22,0:25:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你看的话我就给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.62,0:25:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.85,0:25:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,继续继续
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.78,0:25:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不 我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.78,0:25:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,别在意 我不介意的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.30,0:25:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不不
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.97,0:25:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你想 我可以握给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.56,0:25:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.90,0:25:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.08,0:25:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,很硬吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.52,0:25:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是紧张的表现啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.22,0:25:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们不是这种店
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.28,0:25:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这种店和我们没关系的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.68,0:25:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,其实你也挺感兴趣的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.57,0:26:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,上次你就一直在看我的那个
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.62,0:26:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 没有这回事
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.18,0:26:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定很压抑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.01,0:26:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你的老公没抱过你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.73,0:26:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 我不能说这些
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.90,0:26:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,管他呢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.60,0:26:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,只要能让你舒服就行
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.92,0:26:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.35,0:26:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这边的手 再往下一点 根部那边
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.94,0:26:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 手感真好
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.90,0:26:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你都快陶醉了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.92,0:26:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.44,0:26:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.47,0:26:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,既然做到这一步了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.24,0:26:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,应该没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.90,0:26:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那就多给我揉揉肩膀
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.56,0:26:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 肩膀吗\N- 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.86,0:27:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 从上面做力道不够
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.64,0:27:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你上来坐我身上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.12,0:27:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.86,0:27:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,女人的力气不够解开我的筋
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.44,0:27:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,把我彻底放松了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.16,0:27:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,看 用力点
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.16,0:27:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.03,0:27:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,力度还不够啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.13,0:27:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,再多用点力
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.12,0:28:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.46,0:28:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该是欲望旺盛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.90,0:28:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,别在意 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.78,0:28:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.11,0:28:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,情况上我不能这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.21,0:28:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.48,0:28:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 我会搞定的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.87,0:28:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.00,0:28:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么会有反应
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.56,0:28:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直没说话呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.77,0:28:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你的内裤都湿了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.76,0:29:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,湿气传到我的家伙上了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.29,0:29:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你也动来动去了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.37,0:29:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.10,0:29:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你湿得很厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.76,0:29:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,内裤都湿透了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.34,0:29:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 好热
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.46,0:30:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,真的湿透了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.53,0:30:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该是欲望旺盛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.79,0:30:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,如果真的有硬家伙的话应该会更舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.88,0:31:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,别在意
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.60,0:31:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.62,0:31:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这么舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.28,0:31:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么紧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.34,0:32:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你也蹭来蹭去的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.42,0:32:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定很享受吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.18,0:32:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,人家可没说过这样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.22,0:32:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 别了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.14,0:32:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你的嘴闭着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.22,0:32:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.88,0:32:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 你这么紧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.10,0:32:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,水都出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.98,0:33:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么紧让我忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.30,0:33:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我射了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.08,0:33:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你把我的精液弄出来了\N- 你这么紧让我忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.36,0:33:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太爽了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.36,0:33:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,可是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.41,0:33:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你一点都没有变小
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.70,0:33:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,就是因为你是个好女人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.58,0:33:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,给你看看
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.88,0:34:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,就一次 我还远没到极限呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.12,0:34:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你也觉得不够吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.54,0:34:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你别这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.90,0:34:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我会更用力的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.70,0:34:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你的老公是什么样的我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.16,0:34:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不止一次就够了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.80,0:35:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.42,0:35:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,最近都没人舔过你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.42,0:35:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以帮你好好享受一下
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.80,0:36:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才你说什么来着
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.68,0:36:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你去了就说你去了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.46,0:36:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的舔法你以前没体验过吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.38,0:36:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 没有这样的经历
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.92,0:36:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我会让你开心的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.90,0:37:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,或者你喜欢的是这个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.02,0:37:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.92,0:37:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么这么喜欢这种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.20,0:37:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,看 我要进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.24,0:37:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,停手
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.36,0:37:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,和你老公不一样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.15,0:37:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,太久没见 都忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.82,0:37:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,忍不住了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.34,0:38:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以大声喊出来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.48,0:38:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我的硬度让你感觉很棒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.92,0:38:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你竟然把这么美妙的声音藏起来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.12,0:39:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你又忍不住了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.70,0:39:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我忍不住 你也说不出什么了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.76,0:39:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.80,0:40:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不在里面射是最棒的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.70,0:40:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.26,0:40:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,又忍不住了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.26,0:40:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这样有意思吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.14,0:40:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样还不够呢
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.04,0:41:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是这边吗\N- 你也挺喜欢这样的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.80,0:41:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,别忍着了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.08,0:41:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 我们来试试你能忍多久
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.44,0:41:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我会深入的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.82,0:41:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不动腰你能忍住吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.98,0:41:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,看 你在动呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.06,0:41:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,请多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.40,0:42:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.66,0:42:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.28,0:42:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,又来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.74,0:42:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你还想再来一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.50,0:43:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.82,0:43:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,喔~
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.24,0:43:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,把后面的手拿出来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.54,0:43:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,给我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.16,0:43:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.32,0:44:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,还是很小呢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.86,0:44:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,再进一步就更喜欢了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.08,0:44:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我会继续的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.36,0:44:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.90,0:44:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来轮到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.38,0:45:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉你的身体在碰我
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.12,0:45:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,真是受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.16,0:45:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你的身体太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.55,0:45:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来可以再来几次
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.46,0:45:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.08,0:45:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那我也要出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.72,0:46:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.58,0:46:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这样看 其实是在前面
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.98,0:46:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,感受一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.64,0:47:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.12,0:47:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,流出的液体真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.30,0:47:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们结束吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.10,0:47:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 还不够吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.52,0:47:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们结束吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.10,0:47:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,已经有点习惯了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.36,0:47:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,前台那边也
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.00,0:48:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.50,0:48:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,再让你体验一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.92,0:48:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,现在疼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.24,0:49:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你感觉到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.60,0:49:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这么好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.37,0:49:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是这样的话 下次再来玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.56,0:49:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我今天也回去啦
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.44,0:49:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,夏希夏希 听到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.38,0:49:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯 对不起 我听着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.32,0:49:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像有点累了 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.09,0:50:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吗别太勉强自己
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.96,0:50:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,累了就好好休息
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.30,0:50:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.70,0:50:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.81,0:50:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有什么心事的话 可以找我商量
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.98,0:50:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.68,0:50:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 让你担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.50,0:50:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.07,0:50:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就早点休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.00,0:50:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 好好休息
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.92,0:50:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.12,0:50:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,从那以后吉村就没再来过店里
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.30,0:50:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我在某个地方等着他来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.23,0:51:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这么想着
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.39,0:51:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,真是好久不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.38,0:51:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰你了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.44,0:51:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是很久没见了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.76,0:51:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,很久不见
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.96,0:51:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你大概快憋不住了吧 所以就来了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.72,0:51:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 不是想要吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.86,0:51:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,估计又是湿了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.02,0:52:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,果然还是湿的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.41,0:52:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太想要了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.80,0:52:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,想要的是我的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.86,0:52:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.12,0:52:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.06,0:52:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,身体一点力气都没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.72,0:52:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就是这个吗\N- 是不是想要
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.74,0:53:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,可以摸哦
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.11,0:53:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.62,0:53:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.24,0:53:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.40,0:53:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,也想吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.56,0:53:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,休息一下
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.80,0:53:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.76,0:53:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,蹲下来
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.20,0:54:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来很想加大力度啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.11,0:54:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.79,0:54:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,再让你舒服点
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.88,0:55:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,真是认真地舔着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.04,0:55:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太想要了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.56,0:55:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 别客气
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.66,0:55:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.16,0:55:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么样\N- 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.26,0:55:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.66,0:55:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,别紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.92,0:55:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.44,0:55:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,再来点
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.52,0:55:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很厉害啊 眼睛都快瞪出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.02,0:55:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,拉紧点
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.26,0:55:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 对了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.41,0:56:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,再给我揉紧点
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.04,0:56:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.28,0:56:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.32,0:56:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.38,0:56:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.26,0:56:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.52,0:57:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.02,0:57:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,自己抚摸着 加大力度
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.54,0:57:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,看这边
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.62,0:57:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,祝贺你
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.06,0:57:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.32,0:58:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.14,0:58:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,用舌头舔铃铛
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.69,0:58:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这么用力会射出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.34,0:59:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,把下面拿出来
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.60,0:59:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.84,0:59:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,脱掉
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.78,0:59:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.13,1:00:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么办呢\N- 给我亲一下
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.52,1:00:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,躺下来
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.70,1:00:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你平时都是用油的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.65,1:00:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 是这样的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.54,1:00:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我来帮你用
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.12,1:01:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,真的睡着了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.84,1:01:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,乳头也很敏感啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.92,1:01:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 都硬起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.69,1:02:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,把腿分开点
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.98,1:03:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你平时都是边用油边做的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.56,1:03:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,其实你一直想被这样对待吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.35,1:03:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.98,1:03:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 没那回事
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.02,1:03:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这样帮你就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.11,1:03:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,祝福你
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.62,1:03:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你比刚才睡得更熟了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.79,1:03:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,要走了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.96,1:03:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这个
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.24,1:03:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.48,1:03:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,还不想走呢 快点啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.52,1:03:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,很容易就动情了吧 真棒
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.28,1:04:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.08,1:04:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,自己注意点
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.99,1:04:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.21,1:04:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,把腿抬起来
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.32,1:04:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.50,1:04:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢芒果吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.68,1:04:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才又舔得你怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.42,1:04:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 快了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.38,1:05:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,把手拿开
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.04,1:06:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不要看
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.14,1:07:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,看我的脸
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.94,1:10:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我说不出口
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.90,1:10:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,逃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.32,1:12:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我也可以进去吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.74,1:12:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,听到名字很开心吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.28,1:12:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.96,1:13:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,继续活下去
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.80,1:13:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.64,1:15:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,想要我动吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.76,1:15:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,腰在动呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.84,1:15:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这么想让我动吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.56,1:15:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,乖乖听话吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.76,1:15:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这个
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.06,1:15:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,安静点
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.84,1:16:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是想要我把力道收回来
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.08,1:16:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,疼了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.76,1:16:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,想要我在里面射吗
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.18,1:16:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,如果在里面射了你会受不了的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.74,1:16:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这个
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.60,1:16:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是听话我就只说不做了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.96,1:16:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.86,1:17:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,注意我的感受
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.60,1:18:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,下次你自己来骑我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.14,1:18:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,自己动起来
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.34,1:18:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,自己进去
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.92,1:19:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢自己吗
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.22,1:19:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这么动的话就会射出来哦
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.44,1:20:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,想要我射出来吗
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.60,1:21:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这次轮到我了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.50,1:21:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,让我射出来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.00,1:22:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,平升啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.66,1:23:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.36,1:23:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,太可惜了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.12,1:23:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我想加入你们的团队
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.74,1:23:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,穿得性感点
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.38,1:24:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这个指甲裂开了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.78,1:24:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,全都射进去了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.10,1:24:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要一起去
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.34,1:24:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,别洒出来了哦 看吧 多可惜
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.96,1:24:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,亲姐姐 把肚子给我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.86,1:25:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢我的团队吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.50,1:25:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 老婆 这是救命钱 190万的救命钱
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.44,1:25:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我比你老公更了解你喜欢的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.58,1:25:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这里
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.06,1:26:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,想让我拿出来吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.96,1:26:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,老实点
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.78,1:26:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不是本来的样子
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.58,1:26:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,说吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.40,1:26:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,让我拿出来
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.22,1:26:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不说就不给你射出来哦
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.26,1:26:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这个
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.50,1:26:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,说啊
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.18,1:27:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来一周 你的身体里都是我的精液
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.04,1:27:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,应该很开心吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.64,1:28:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,真不错
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.92,1:28:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你的家吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.46,1:28:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那你们应该有卧室
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.00,1:28:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,在那里做吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.10,1:28:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,还不够
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.98,1:28:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.98,1:28:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我又来了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.54,1:29:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.10,1:29:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,刚下班 有点出汗
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.68,1:30:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,闻起来不错吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.18,1:30:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.90,1:30:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.78,1:30:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,想要我来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.64,1:31:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我请客
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.12,1:31:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,让我舔你的屁股
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.20,1:31:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,跪下来让我舔屁股
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.72,1:31:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是屁股
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.72,1:32:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你的下面都快满了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.62,1:32:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好难受啊
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.80,1:32:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好臭
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.58,1:32:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,停不下来了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.42,1:32:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,一直往外流
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.74,1:33:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.26,1:34:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事 表情这么奇怪
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.98,1:34:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 真爽
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.86,1:35:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,进去了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.10,1:35:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,已经进去了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.14,1:35:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,已经射出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.74,1:36:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上好
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.30,1:37:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.74,1:37:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.08,1:37:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,亲一下吧
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.04,1:38:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想让你受不了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.76,1:38:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你让我受不了了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.46,1:39:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有人在社交平台上写吃饭的帖子
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.60,1:39:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.06,1:39:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.68,1:39:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.32,1:39:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.36,1:39:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么样\N- 哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.72,1:39:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.88,1:39:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,行吧
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.18,1:40:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.02,1:40:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.64,1:40:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.82,1:40:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不想死
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.74,1:40:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 弄疼我了
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.88,1:40:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,紧得很
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.86,1:40:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.21,1:40:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,湿透了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.18,1:40:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.49,1:40:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我想放 我想放 没办法吧
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.86,1:41:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,看看 看看 说出来吧你想要吧
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.74,1:41:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说什么\N- 您请
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.20,1:41:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不行的是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.00,1:41:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,老兄
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.68,1:41:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,因为
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.24,1:41:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.82,1:41:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,请给我来一下
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.08,1:41:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.56,1:41:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,紧得很
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.82,1:41:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,要睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.20,1:41:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这边来
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.40,1:42:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 不行
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.86,1:42:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不行
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.28,1:42:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 疼
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.50,1:42:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你都快受不了了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.46,1:42:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我也忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.00,1:42:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,想要我拿出来吗
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.30,1:42:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,想要我来点吗
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.60,1:42:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要吧
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.20,1:42:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我会让你多出来的
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.26,1:42:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要吧
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.66,1:43:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,再说清楚点
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.70,1:43:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,老师你想要我怎么做
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.92,1:43:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.72,1:43:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.22,1:43:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀别这样嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.54,1:44:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.70,1:45:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,想要高潮吗
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.42,1:45:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,想要
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.26,1:45:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想要
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.88,1:45:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么做呢
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.14,1:45:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,又要来了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.00,1:45:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 我来
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.32,1:45:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我来
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.82,1:46:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,把它弄干净
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.20,1:47:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,硬吗
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.36,1:47:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,还想多来点
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.36,1:47:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,把屁股转过来
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.74,1:48:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.30,1:48:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.70,1:48:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,疼
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.36,1:50:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 还不够吗
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.60,1:50:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,再说一遍
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.64,1:50:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,听不见啊
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.24,1:50:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,清楚地说出来
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.64,1:51:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,过来这边
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.52,1:51:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,太舒服了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.62,1:51:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,下一次声音再深一点
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.24,1:51:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.48,1:51:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候会说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.76,1:52:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不想继续了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.22,1:52:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,疼吗
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.98,1:52:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,贴纸出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.94,1:52:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么这么做呢
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.14,1:52:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 好厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.46,1:53:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,像由子那样做吧
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.00,1:54:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这么多舌头舔过的地方从来没有过
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.42,1:54:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.18,1:54:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.98,1:54:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.68,1:55:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 太舒服了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.52,1:57:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,再求更多一点
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.06,1:57:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,来了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.38,1:57:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,请来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.82,1:57:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,太舒服了
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.10,1:57:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,让我躺下吧
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.16,1:58:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,下次预告
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.98,1:59:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,吞下去了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:30.40,1:59:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,宇太
Dialogue: 0,1:59:32.34,1:59:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,只有你回来这段时间
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.76,1:59:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,请原谅这样的我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:17.00,Watermark,,0,0,0,,成人世界里,一个就够了\N ONE一个
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.13,0:59:55.13,Watermark,,0,0,0,,成人世界里,一个就够了\N ONE一个
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.26,1:59:13.26,Watermark,,0,0,0,,成人世界里,一个就够了\N ONE一个

